+ "Thimsy doesn't include BIOS files. Pick a folder with BIOS and firmware files dumped from your own consoles, and Thimsy copies each file it recognises, whatever its name, to the emulators that need it. Most systems work without them. Nothing already installed is overwritten.": "Thimsy indeholder ingen BIOS-filer. Vælg en mappe med BIOS- og firmwarefiler, du har udlæst fra dine egne konsoller, så kopierer Thimsy hver fil, den genkender, uanset navn, til de emulatorer, der skal bruge den. De fleste systemer virker uden. Intet, der allerede er installeret, overskrives.",
+ "Thimsy doesn't include BIOS files. If you have BIOS files dumped from your own consoles, Thimsy can copy them to the emulators that need them.": "Thimsy indeholder ingen BIOS-filer. Hvis du har BIOS-filer udlæst fra dine egne konsoller, kan Thimsy kopiere dem til de emulatorer, der skal bruge dem.",
+ "This step is optional: most systems work without BIOS files. You can add them any time later from %s.": "Dette trin er valgfrit: De fleste systemer virker uden BIOS-filer. Du kan tilføje dem når som helst senere fra %s.",
+ "Have your own BIOS files? Choose %s and pick the folder they're in. If not, choose %s.": "Har du dine egne BIOS-filer? Vælg %s, og vælg den mappe, de ligger i. Ellers skal du vælge %s.",
+ "Select Folder": "Vælg mappe",
+ "No BIOS files that Thimsy recognises were found in this folder. Thimsy doesn't include BIOS files: you need to provide your own, dumped from your consoles.": "Der blev ikke fundet BIOS-filer, som Thimsy genkender, i denne mappe. Thimsy indeholder ingen BIOS-filer: Du skal selv levere dine egne, udlæst fra dine konsoller.",
