+ "DSi Menu theme only: plays the looping ambient background music on the DSi home. Turn off for a silent menu. Applies immediately.": "仅限DSi菜单主题：在DSi主界面循环播放环境背景音乐。关闭则菜单静音。立即生效。",
+ "DSi Menu theme only: switches the DSi home to a dark variant (dark field, light text and icons) for low-light use. Applies immediately.": "仅限DSi菜单主题：将DSi主界面切换为深色版本(深色背景、浅色文字和图标)，适合弱光环境。立即生效。",
+ "DSi theme only: on a tall single screen, show both DS screens stacked (top + bottom) or just the bottom launcher. Auto stacks on a tall (portrait) screen. Real dual-screen devices always use both panels.": "仅限DSi主题：在竖长的单屏上，显示堆叠的两个DS屏幕(上+下)，或仅显示下屏启动器。自动：在竖长(竖屏)屏幕上堆叠显示。真正的双屏设备始终使用两个面板。",
+ "DSi theme only: the gap between the stacked top and bottom screens (the DS hinge). Larger values push each screen toward its edge (snap to top/bottom).": "仅限DSi主题：堆叠的上下屏幕之间的间距(DS铰链)。数值越大，每个屏幕越靠近边缘(贴紧顶部/底部)。",
+ "Darkens a custom photo or video wallpaper so a bright image does not wash out the icons or menu text. Higher = darker.": "调暗自定义照片或视频壁纸，避免明亮的画面淹没图标或菜单文字。数值越高越暗。",
